---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'November 23, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — ImageSqueeze"
  description="ImageSqueeze's privacy policy. Your images are processed entirely in your browser and are never uploaded, stored or shared."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description={`Effective date: ${effectiveDate}. The short version: your images never leave your device.`}
  />

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <p class="!mt-0">
          ImageSqueeze (“we”, “us”, “our”) operates this website (the “Site”).
          This policy explains what information we collect and how we handle
          it. We collect as little as possible, and your images never leave
          your device.
        </p>

        <h2>Images you process</h2>
        <p>
          ImageSqueeze is a client-side tool. When you add images, they are
          read by your browser and processed locally. They are not uploaded,
          transmitted, stored or shared by us. Closing or refreshing the page
          clears them from memory. Downloads are saved directly by your browser.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not require an account and do not ask for personal information.
          We do not operate a backend that receives your files. If you choose to
          email us, we receive your email address and message, and use them only
          to respond to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Local storage</h2>
        <p>
          We store a single preference in your browser’s local storage: your
          theme choice (“light” or “dark”). This stays on your device and is not
          sent to us. You can clear it by clearing your browser’s site data.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          The Site does not use advertising cookies or third-party analytics.
          If we add privacy-friendly analytics in the future, we will update
          this policy and, where required, ask for consent.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site may link to third-party websites. We are not responsible for
          their content or privacy practices. Please review their policies
          before providing personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly
          collect personal information from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The effective date above
          will change when we do. Continued use of the Site after an update
          means you accept the revised policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email
          <a href="mailto:hello@imagesqueeze.com">hello@imagesqueeze.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
